            $body = "<h2>Surtido de bellota 100% ibérico</h2><p>Incluye medio lomo de aproximadamente 0,5 kg, medio salchichón de aproximadamente 0,5 kg y medio chorizo de aproximadamente 0,5 kg, con un peso total aproximado de 1,5 kg. Las tres elaboraciones proceden de cerdos de bellota 100% ibéricos criados en libertad en la dehesa.</p><h2>Cómo servirlo</h2><p>Corta cada pieza en lonchas finas y sirve a temperatura ambiente. Es un formato adecuado para preparar una tabla variada de ibéricos.</p>{$producer}<h2>Preguntas frecuentes</h2><h3>¿Qué incluye el surtido?</h3><p>Medio lomo, medio salchichón y medio chorizo.</p><h3>¿Cuál es el peso total?</h3><p>Aproximadamente 1,5 kg.</p>";
        } else {
            $short = "100% Iberian acorn-fed assortment with half a cured loin, half a salchichón and half a chorizo, approximately 0.5 kg each and around 1.5 kg in total.";
            $body = "<h2>100% Iberian acorn-fed assortment</h2><p>Includes approximately 0.5 kg of cured loin, 0.5 kg of salchichón and 0.5 kg of chorizo, for an approximate total weight of 1.5 kg. All three products come from 100% Iberian acorn-fed pigs raised free-range in the dehesa.</p><h2>How to serve it</h2><p>Slice each piece thinly and serve at room temperature. It is a convenient format for a varied Iberian charcuterie board.</p>{$producer}<h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>What does the assortment include?</h3><p>Half a cured loin, half a salchichón and half a chorizo.</p><h3>What is the total weight?</h3><p>Approximately 1.5 kg.</p>";
